# Changelog

## [0.6.1]

- **Massive memory footprint reduction**
  Solved the issue where WASM linear memory never shrinks. Resident memory dropped
from 1.1 GB / 550 MB (first-time / subsequent loads) to 327 MB / 305 MB. 

## [0.6.0]

- Performance: Support for symmetric pruning table 
- Persistence: Support to customize table directory
- Others: Upgrade underlying C++/wasm library to v0.5.1